# graphify output: commit only the shareable graph artifacts.
# Everything else here is regenerable cache or machine-local state:
#   cache/            - extraction cache (1.4MB, rebuilt on demand)
#   .graphify_python  - absolute path to this machine's interpreter
#   .graphify_root    - absolute scan-root path for this machine
#   .graphify_labels.json, cost.json - local run state
# Whitelist approach: ignore all, then un-ignore the four artifacts we version.
*
!.gitignore
!graph.json
!graph.html
!GRAPH_REPORT.md
!manifest.json
